p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, his fate is in your hands. Can his story end in a happy ending?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578500/extras/a1c341c8f442b9287200042789f61a39.poster.avif?t=1768905893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578500/extras/a1c341c8f442b9287200042789f61a39.webm?t=1768905893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
